# Deployment

This frontend project is deployed on a **free (Hobby) Vercel** account.

## Implications for changes

- Keep client uploads within Vercel Hobby request body limits (~**4.5 MB**). Sequence attachments and similar uploads should stay at or below **4 MB** per file unless hosting changes.
- Prefer lightweight client bundles; avoid shipping large unused dependencies.
- Do not assume long-running server-side work in Next.js route handlers beyond Hobby function limits; heavy jobs belong on the API worker, not the FE deployment.
